*===============================================================================
* SCENARIO SETTINGS
* =================
* Free-form scenario code, included late in SASM2025.gms (after section 6.3b) when
* $setGlobal scenariosettings yes is set in settings.gms.
*
* Use this file for scenario-specific assignments that are not prepared as switches
* in settings.gms. The file is included at compile time, so only GAMS statements
* that are valid at that point in the model may be placed here.
*
* Left empty on purpose: the file is tracked so that the include never fails.
*===============================================================================
